    "# 🌌 RAI v8 — Large Procedural World Engine & Multi-Scale Uncertainty Architecture\n",
    "### Zero-Shot Sim-to-Real Transfer via Combinatorial World Diversity\n",
    "\n",
    "**Core Paradigm Shift:**\n",
    "* *Old Hypothesis (v6 / v7)*: \"Make synthetic data look more realistic.\"\n",
    "* **RAI v8 Hypothesis**: \"Transfer does not require realism; it requires sufficient diversity and combinatorial coverage of possible worlds.\"\n",
    "\n",
    "**RAI v8 Innovations:**\n",
    "1. 🌌 **Large Procedural World Engine ($W_{proc}$)**: Generates millions of synthetic financial universes across arbitrary asset dynamics, GARCH volatility, heavy tails, jumps, and correlation breakdowns.\n",
    "2. 🧠 **Multi-Scale Uncertainty Architecture**: Short/Medium/Long temporal encoders (3d, 10d, 30d) + Cross-Asset Attention + Risk & Epistemic Uncertainty Estimation Head ($\sigma_{risk}^2$).\n",
    "3. 🔒 **Epistemic Integrity Protocol**: 0% Real market data intake during training. Policy frozen and evaluated single-pass across 4 untouched global domains (India NSE, US Tech, Forex/Commodities, Crypto)."
   ]
  },
